## Carsai OS - core package list (Debian bookworm, amd64)
## Goal: full XFCE desktop, lean services, <= 800 MB idle RAM (2 GB minimum).
## Built with --apt-recommends false (see auto/config), which keeps
## "suggested" packages out of the image.

### X + XFCE desktop
xorg
xfce4
xfce4-terminal
thunar-archive-plugin
lightdm
lightdm-gtk-greeter
network-manager-gnome
gvfs
xdg-user-dirs
accountsservice

### Desktop usability extras
ristretto
xarchiver
network-manager
adwaita-icon-theme
xfce4-taskmanager
xfce4-screenshooter
xfce4-clipman-plugin
pulseaudio
pavucontrol

### Screen locking (xflock4 backend, Win+L)
xscreensaver

### XFCE panel plugins (statusbar + start menu)
xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin
xfce4-genmon-plugin
xfce4-systemload-plugin
xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin

### Text editor + terminal tooling
mousepad
nano
vim
htop
bash-completion

### Basic userland
curl
wget
git
unzip
zip
xz-utils

### Windows (.exe) compatibility layer - Wine 64-bit (32-bit via hook)
wine
wine64
winetricks
fonts-wine
cabextract

### Hacker terminal toolkit
btop
neofetch
tmux
ranger
ncdu
cmatrix
xdotool
wmctrl

### Web browser
firefox-esr

### Fonts: identity (JetBrains Mono) + coverage (Noto)
fonts-noto-core
fonts-jetbrains-mono

### Memory management for low-RAM machines
zram-tools

### Firmware for common Wi-Fi/GPU hardware on real machines
firmware-linux-free
firmware-misc-nonfree
